15 0 obj
<< /A 39 0 R /Alt (Infographic illustrating a seven-step AI evaluation process: standardized prompt, four AI tools \(ChatGPT, Gemini, DeepSeek, Doubao\), five generations per tool, twenty outputs, anonymization and randomization, expert evaluation by thirty-two swimming coaches, and statistical analysis of quality scores and comparisons.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 28 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
16 0 obj
<< /A 40 0 R /Alt (Heatmap comparing mean domain scores across ChatGPT, Gemini, DeepSeek, and Doubao for ten quality domains including overall quality, innovation, clarity, arrangement, applicability, individualization, safety, targeting, completeness, and validity, with scores ranging from two point sixty-two to four point fifty-eight.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 33 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
17 0 obj
<< /A 41 0 R /Alt (Three data visualizations compare four AI models \(ChatGPT, Gemini, DeepSeek, Doubao\) on expert-rated score stability. \(a\) Line charts show overall mean scores for five versions, with ChatGPT and Gemini higher and more variable than DeepSeek and Doubao. \(b\) Bar chart displays coefficient of variation \(CV\) for all models; Doubao has the lowest CV, ChatGPT the highest. \(c\) Two bar charts compare CVs by section \(\215Cool-down\216 and \215Warm-up\216\), also showing Doubao with lower variation, ChatGPT with the highest.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 34 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
